  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "埃及"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張雅雯</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">便若歇熱ê時tsūn，一定ài出國遊覽來解心悶。Iáu-m̄-koh為著儉錢出國，平常時lóng ài過儉腸neh肚ê生活，tsiah ē-sái逐冬出國。我去--過ê國家內底，印象上好，上hōo人siàu念--ê，就是逐家tiānn-tiānn聽--著ê古早文明之一——埃及。Pōo-pîn出國lóng考慮日本、東南亞iah是歐洲，好佳哉因為看著一張騎駱駝ê相片，hōo我決定tī 2019年去埃及，準備齊全了後，就是九工ê旅行。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人講「一鄉有一俗」，各地頭風俗無仝，國家mā是仝款。埃及是一个異國風情tsiânn明顯koh tsiânn趣味ê所在，規个國家上濟--ê就是木乃伊kap金字塔，濟kah又koh起一間50萬平方公尺、世界上大ê考古博物館。若講著有tsiânn濟木乃伊ê所在，就是<i>Luxor</i> ê帝王谷，聽名就知影tsia有帝王ê墓，連山頭lóng tsiânn做一位帝王the tī hia ê身影。帝王谷lóng總有64个墓，上出名--ê就是<i>Tutankhamun</i>（『圖坦卡門』），我ke khai五百箍參觀伊ê墓，雖bóng墓室細細間仔，mā看bē著黃金面罩，iáu-m̄-koh有色水真鬥搭ê壁畫，koh ē-sái親目看著<i>Tutankhamun</i> ê蔭屍。想bē到the tī面頭前ê細漢囡仔就是伊，就án-ne hōo人看現現，3,000年前ê伊ē按怎想？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">自早就ǹg望有一日ē-sái tī沙漠騎駱駝，tsit个願望tī埃及實現--ah。Tsit工天iáu未光，阮就來到<i>Sahara</i>（『撒哈拉』）沙漠等待日頭ê現身，徛tī hia看bē著路尾，kan-na有起起落落ê沙崙，hōo人感覺人生茫茫渺渺，m̄知影suà--落-來 uì佗位去？一目nih仔日頭就親像一粒拄sa̍h好ê卵仁，沓沓仔浮--起-來，愈來愈kuân、愈來愈溫暖，kánn-ná leh kā我講「心頭掠hōo定，大步向前行。」凡勢mā ē-sái揣著人生ê日頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsia ê遊牧民族叫做<i>Bedouin</i>（『貝都因』）人，現此時有一寡仔人固定蹛tī tsia，tsia ê囡仔tī沙仔頂面走ná飛，無親像我勻勻仔行，koh行kah kiōng-beh khōng跤翹，我想tse無定著就是人講ê「拖沙」！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來到<i>Sahara</i>沙漠koh有一个心適ê活動，就是騎駱駝。蹛tī hia ê人ē tī頭前牽--leh，聽講駱駝ê目空是長篙形，細漢囡仔tī in ê大蕊目睭內底，是一个tsiok大漢ê人，所以in m̄敢假痟，kan-na向前kho̍k-kho̍k行。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭前一个60幾歲ê阿姨，uì駱駝頂kuân peh--落-來了後，kā我ê手牽--leh，「佳哉我細漢有騎過牛，若無就ē倒siàng-hiànn，摔摔--落-來--ah。」我心內感覺伊tsiânn hàm古，kan-na是騎駱駝niā-niā，kám有hiah嚴重？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我原本beh選一隻上古錐--ê，想bē到揀--啊揀，揀著一隻上kài kuân--ê，tsit聲害--ah，手huānn仔tio̍h-ài huānn hōo好，因為坐tī kuân頂就親像坐tī踏bē著塗跤ê船，只要無張持就ē跋--落-來，邊--a ê少年妹仔koh ē-sái一手攑手機仔，ná排姿勢ná hip相，無親像我坐kah tshu-tshu，緊張kah心肝頭pho̍k-pho̍k-tshíng。阿姨ê話無白賊，原來hip一張騎駱駝ê相，ē hip kah心驚膽hiannh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">埃及ê金字塔、人面獅身lóng tsiok出名，lóng想beh入去參觀，總--是排隊排kah lò-lò長。尤其是金字塔——我m̄ bat看過tsiah-nī仔偉大ê作品，若講是宇宙人起--ê，絕對bē有一點仔懷疑，因為有真濟所在，iáu是看ē著科技ê神秘跤跡。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit兩年因為疫情ê關係，我tsiok久無出國--ah，tsia̍p-tsia̍p想著hit tsuā旅行，好佳哉我有kā Sahara沙漠ê沙仔紮--tńg-來，hit罐沙仔就án-ne恬恬仔徛tī桌頂，hōo我對下一个旅程有無限ê期待，mā hōo我體會著「如常」是tsiah-nī仔寶貴。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjewxZ1HhkuIc7jCjUPLuGdv5U5eYhDahHvc1MAPsGGo5xmUwd0my8Vad07Ak2JEbf4oRuzokeFrmOkWwXgqvb_qFo8vQY1AREVkyTsN_0Odlpmv-TVauqTs7r-GyNmUq0JnyWyIqj7PpQmAhkNAOROZ1o8pLfzLanqsAAbnA9UN3rVUe82_xIpSLZvXpar/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8130.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjewxZ1HhkuIc7jCjUPLuGdv5U5eYhDahHvc1MAPsGGo5xmUwd0my8Vad07Ak2JEbf4oRuzokeFrmOkWwXgqvb_qFo8vQY1AREVkyTsN_0Odlpmv-TVauqTs7r-GyNmUq0JnyWyIqj7PpQmAhkNAOROZ1o8pLfzLanqsAAbnA9UN3rVUe82_xIpSLZvXpar/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%8130.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPnApuZcN0vcCoHwbR_jLbBADN0VQs0k1uixhVdA-2e21QOQ8MQiGkko7Lsa08urpTMFIRovzcrMA5ylwwU8NEdhlZ9Zs64urCBzZlbIkSafKY7Wtn8a1NJB801lHeSn5L6Wnpe_kaYil_PbZiZy7q0xgRE8f3NjpBFaiojFNeLUWd05Wo4fDc9nsF46nk/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_029.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPnApuZcN0vcCoHwbR_jLbBADN0VQs0k1uixhVdA-2e21QOQ8MQiGkko7Lsa08urpTMFIRovzcrMA5ylwwU8NEdhlZ9Zs64urCBzZlbIkSafKY7Wtn8a1NJB801lHeSn5L6Wnpe_kaYil_PbZiZy7q0xgRE8f3NjpBFaiojFNeLUWd05Wo4fDc9nsF46nk/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_029.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7U4GBYB_pCwiPZOrWYlYs8wL5e_JXdpOTxq5_9GjF9Km078o0aIxOUYVHTWHaLRohYKhSvY2GHixi1Pa9jifjTWaLeBfEq2NvIYHJ_1EwG4qUQ87_FOaTJ6KTFZQZOm9smh_vvuvXuxoosd05BGz25-SzCDCdrXXJunfTup76kzou2GomGsqZeREn_o8H/s1424/356%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi7U4GBYB_pCwiPZOrWYlYs8wL5e_JXdpOTxq5_9GjF9Km078o0aIxOUYVHTWHaLRohYKhSvY2GHixi1Pa9jifjTWaLeBfEq2NvIYHJ_1EwG4qUQ87_FOaTJ6KTFZQZOm9smh_vvuvXuxoosd05BGz25-SzCDCdrXXJunfTup76kzou2GomGsqZeREn_o8H/w450-h640/356%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#光景bóng uē&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding